import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 864 | Transcended Ones and Culture | The Transcended One's Cultural Responsibility","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 864 | Transcended Ones and Culture | The Transcended One's Cultural Responsibility","no":864,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Cultural Responsibility","Cultural Guardianship","Guidance","Non-Monopolization"],"related":["847-Civilizational Aesthetics","861-Cultural-Construction Overview","862-Myriad-Rank Cultural Intermingling and Protection","863-Symbiotic-Culture Creation and Dissemination"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0864_模块4-超脱者与文化-超脱者文化责任.md","filePath":"en/0864_模块4-超脱者与文化-超脱者文化责任.md"}`),s={name:"en/0864_模块4-超脱者与文化-超脱者文化责任.md"};function r(o,e,l,u,h,d){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-864-transcended-ones-and-culture-the-transcended-one-s-cultural-responsibility" tabindex="-1">Entry 864 | Transcended Ones and Culture | The Transcended One&#39;s Cultural Responsibility <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-864-transcended-ones-and-culture-the-transcended-one-s-cultural-responsibility" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 864 | Transcended Ones and Culture | The Transcended One&#39;s Cultural Responsibility&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 847, 861, 862, 863</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-strongest-has-a-guardianship-duty-over-the-hearts-battlefield" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the strongest has a guardianship duty over the &quot;hearts&quot; battlefield <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-strongest-has-a-guardianship-duty-over-the-hearts-battlefield" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the strongest has a guardianship duty over the &quot;hearts&quot; battlefield&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s cultural responsibility is in the same lineage as his historical responsibility and educational responsibility — he is strong, therefore he bears guardianship for Myriad Ranks&#39; spiritual world. This entry specifically treats this cultural responsibility: what the transcended one concretely must and must not do in the cultural field, and how to prevent his own cultural influence from becoming new cultural hegemony.</p><p>Six top-level axioms centrally fulfill <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong>: cultural responsibility serves Myriad Ranks&#39; spiritual well-being; <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong> opposes using culture as a predatory tool; <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> requires culture nourish common upward movement; <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong> requires cultural influence be supervised; <strong>the law-first axiom</strong> requires responsibility boundaries be self-consistent and stable.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-cultural-responsibility-s-four-contents" tabindex="-1">I. Cultural Responsibility&#39;s Four Contents <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-cultural-responsibility-s-four-contents" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Cultural Responsibility&#39;s Four Contents&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s cultural responsibility concretely has four contents:</p><ol><li><strong>Guard diversity</strong>: protect endangered-clan cultures, prevent cultural extinction (entry 862);</li><li><strong>Create base color</strong>: take the lead in creating and disseminating symbiotic culture (entry 863);</li><li><strong>Guide aesthetics</strong>: lead civilizational aesthetics toward symbiosis (entry 847);</li><li><strong>Guard public opinion</strong>: be wary of predatory rhetoric and short-cut inner demons spreading in the cultural field.</li></ol><p>Four together, the transcended one is Myriad Ranks&#39; spiritual world&#39;s &quot;gardener&quot; — he does not grow the flowers for them; he weeds, waters, props up.</p><h2 id="ii-cultural-responsibility-and-not-overstepping" tabindex="-1">II. Cultural Responsibility and &quot;Not Overstepping&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-cultural-responsibility-and-not-overstepping" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Cultural Responsibility and &quot;Not Overstepping&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The hardest part of cultural responsibility is not &quot;what to do,&quot; but &quot;what not to do.&quot; The transcended one must hold several boundaries:</p><ul><li><strong>Do not monopolize culture</strong>: culture is not his private estate; Myriad Ranks have the right to create in their own way;</li><li><strong>Do not impose culture</strong>: do not force Myriad Ranks to accept some culture; only exemplify, do not command;</li><li><strong>Do not manipulate hearts</strong>: consciousness art (entry 849) reaches hearts directly, so must especially strictly not manipulate;</li><li><strong>Do not conduct cultural trials</strong>: do not label culture &quot;not in symbiosis&quot; as heresy — diversity coexists.</li></ul><p><strong>Cultural responsibility is &quot;guard&quot; and &quot;guide,&quot; not &quot;manage&quot; and &quot;suppress.&quot;</strong></p><h2 id="iii-cultural-responsibility-and-civilizational-weight" tabindex="-1">III. Cultural Responsibility and Civilizational Weight <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-cultural-responsibility-and-civilizational-weight" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Cultural Responsibility and Civilizational Weight&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Like historical responsibility, cultural responsibility is also quantified into civilizational-weight assessment (entry 706):</p><ul><li>Contribution in guarding endangered cultures;</li><li>Quality of results in creating symbiotic culture;</li><li>Effect in guiding aesthetics;</li><li>Practical record of anti-predation in the cultural field.</li></ul><p>If a transcended one neglects culture — letting predatory rhetoric spread and cultural extinction run free — his civilizational weight drops, even affecting tenure qualification. <strong>Culture is not a &quot;soft indicator&quot;; it counts into the transcended one&#39;s hard assessment.</strong></p><h2 id="iv-why-the-strongest-most-must-hold-the-cultural-bottom-line" tabindex="-1">IV. Why the Strongest Most Must Hold the Cultural Bottom Line <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-why-the-strongest-most-must-hold-the-cultural-bottom-line" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Why the Strongest Most Must Hold the Cultural Bottom Line&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The cultural field is most easily exploited by the strong — he may use force to impose his own culture on Myriad Ranks, turning it into cultural hegemony. Precisely because of this, Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s cultural constraints on the transcended one are instead the strictest:</p><ul><li>The more he can influence hearts, the more he must restrain himself;</li><li>The stronger he is, the less he may &quot;conquer&quot; Myriad Ranks with culture;</li><li>He himself is first a practitioner of symbiotic culture, then its guide.</li></ul><p><strong>The strongest&#39;s cultural responsibility is first managing his own strongest hand.</strong></p><p>Cultural responsibility is not an abstract slogan; it has concrete guardianship objects. When a weak race faces cultural extinction — fewer than a hundred people still speak their language, their epics only passed mouth to mouth — the transcended one has the duty to deploy civilizational-engineering resources to establish a cultural backup for them: the Alaya Network fully archives that race&#39;s language, music, rituals, crafts, and reserves a cultural enclave for that race in safe isolation space, so they need not be forced to assimilate into mainstream culture for survival. This guardianship is not treating them as exhibits, but winning them a breathing period — wait until they themselves are willing to open exchange, then take the normal intermingling channel. The strongest&#39;s guardianship over the &quot;hearts&quot; battlefield manifests precisely in this meticulous work others find troublesome and unwilling to do.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: use the transcended one&#39;s cultural influence to guard Myriad Ranks&#39; spirit, not waste it on contending for hegemony or hanging up</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: cultural responsibility is anti-predation from the heart layer, while strictly preventing cultural hegemony</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style strong ones use culture to dominate Myriad Ranks; the Heng Yuan Zhou transcended one holds the cultural bottom line and does not overstep</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: cultural responsibility faces all clans, guarding their diversity and respecting their autonomy</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: cultural responsibility&#39;s contents, boundaries, and assessment all public network-wide</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-cultural-responsibility-s-boundary-and-supervision" tabindex="-1">Supplement: Cultural Responsibility&#39;s Boundary and Supervision <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-cultural-responsibility-s-boundary-and-supervision" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: Cultural Responsibility&#39;s Boundary and Supervision&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The hardest part of the transcended one&#39;s cultural responsibility is &quot;not overstepping.&quot; While he guards diversity, creates the base color, and guides aesthetics, he must hold the boundaries of not monopolizing, not imposing, not manipulating, not judging — this boundary is watched by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision. His cultural contributions are counted into civilizational weight by actual effect; once derelict (letting predatory rhetoric run free, engaging in cultural hegemony), weight immediately drops. Precisely because the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&#39;s constraints on the strongest&#39;s cultural influence are the strictest, Myriad Ranks&#39; spiritual world is both guided upward and not ruled by anyone.</p><p>This cultural responsibility must especially protect easygoing and ordinary beings: they inherently possess a guaranteed basic infinity; culture must not only praise Youth Supremes, but make every layabout feel he belongs to this civilization and will not be abandoned.</p><p>When the transcended one truly achieves this &quot;not eliminating anyone&quot; guardianship, cultural responsibility is considered fully landed.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s cultural responsibility is his guardianship duty over &quot;the hearts battlefield.&quot; He guards diversity, creates the base color, guides aesthetics, and guards public opinion, while firmly holding the boundaries of &quot;not monopolizing, not imposing, not manipulating, not judging.&quot; This responsibility is counted into civilizational weight; the stronger the one, the more he must restrain. When the transcended one uses cultural influence in guarding rather than conquest, in guidance rather than imposition, Myriad Ranks&#39; spiritual world both grows upward and breathes freely. This is the transcended one&#39;s orthodox role in the cultural dimension.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/847_模块4-超脱者与艺术-文明美学.html">Entry 847 · Civilizational Aesthetics</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/861_模块4-超脱者与文化-总论.html">Entry 861 · Cultural-Construction Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/862_模块4-超脱者与文化-万族文化交融与保护.html">Entry 862 · Myriad-Rank Cultural Intermingling and Protection</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/863_模块4-超脱者与文化-共生文化创造与传播.html">Entry 863 · Symbiotic-Culture Creation and Dissemination</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',34)])])}const g=t(s,[["render",r]]);export{p as __pageData,g as default};
